{"4304020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Puma Cowboy", "steam_appid": 4304020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cowboy cat gunning down invisible ghosts with revolver loaded with special bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with observing enemies, predicting their movements and destroying everyone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wave after wave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt Invisible Ghosts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that only reveal outside of arena<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/f77dafa6fdf3bba2f62880608999f1e0.poster.avif?t=1786907298\" width=444 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/f77dafa6fdf3bba2f62880608999f1e0.webm?t=1786907298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/f77dafa6fdf3bba2f62880608999f1e0.mp4?t=1786907298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting Bullet System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge special bullets into one bullet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/9b95806e01fe0c92e1674b776bc556a6.poster.avif?t=1786907298\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/9b95806e01fe0c92e1674b776bc556a6.webm?t=1786907298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4304020/extras/9b95806e01fe0c92e1674b776bc556a6.mp4?t=1786907298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features: